sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent
    participant SH as shell MCP
    participant C7 as context7 MCP
    participant FS as filesystem MCP
    participant H as stop-gate hook
    participant GH as github MCP
    participant W as fetch MCP

    A->>SH: pytest -q
    SH-->>A: 5 pass, 2 fail<br/>ImportError: 'retry' undefined
    Note over A: BEFORE captured

    A->>SH: ruff --version
    SH-->>A: not found
    Note over A: §1.4 defect (missing tooling)

    A->>C7: resolve-library-id("ruff")
    C7-->>A: /astral-sh/ruff
    A->>C7: get-library-docs(pinned=0.7.x)
    C7-->>A: install + config docs
    Note over A: §2.1 source captured

    A->>SH: python -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install ruff==0.7.*
    SH-->>A: installed
    A->>FS: write tasks/todo.md<br/>provenance + undo path
    FS-->>A: ok

    A->>SH: .venv/bin/ruff check .
    SH-->>A: 42 errors
    Note over A: correct() loop fires

    A->>GH: search_code("retry helper python <this repo>")
    GH-->>A: repo already has src/util/retry.py
    A->>FS: read src/util/retry.py
    FS-->>A: retry() exists, exported
    Note over A: §2.4 reuse repo code

    A->>FS: edit test_imports.py → from src.util.retry import retry
    A->>SH: .venv/bin/ruff check .
    SH-->>A: 0 errors, 42 fixed
    A->>SH: pytest -q
    SH-->>A: 7 pass

    A->>SH: .venv/bin/ruff format --check .
    SH-->>A: 3 would reformat → run ruff format → 0
    A->>SH: mypy .
    SH-->>A: success

    Note over A: Write ALL GREEN to tasks/.logs/clean-room.log

    A->>H: Stop
    H-->>A: PASS (clean-room.log = ALL GREEN,<br/>no unchecked todo, no bare [unverified])